1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,614
The agent workspace is where an agent works a shift.

2
00:00:04,614 --> 00:00:08,352
This video shows the three places an agent works from:

3
00:00:08,352 --> 00:00:12,090
the soft phone, My workspace and the docked agent bar.

4
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:17,510
It covers how to sign in to queues, set presence, and read what each screen says.

5
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,709
A shift has a rhythm:

6
00:00:23,709 --> 00:00:27,382
sign in, say you are ready, take work, finish the notes.

7
00:00:27,382 --> 00:00:32,120
An agent needs to see their state and their work without searching for it.

8
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,636
Three things carry it.

9
00:00:34,636 --> 00:00:38,925
The soft phone holds the call audio, and is where you sign in.

10
00:00:38,925 --> 00:00:42,899
My workspace shows your presence, queues and recent work.

11
00:00:42,899 --> 00:00:46,620
The docked agent bar follows you to every admin page.

12
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:53,615
Open the soft phone and My workspace.

13
00:00:53,615 --> 00:00:57,320
Sign in to the queues and campaigns you work today.

14
00:00:58,070 --> 00:01:02,138
Set your presence to Available when you are ready, or pick a reason

15
00:01:02,138 --> 00:01:03,420
when you are not.

16
00:01:04,170 --> 00:01:06,524
Accept or decline each offer.

17
00:01:06,524 --> 00:01:09,550
Dialer work opens its activity for you.

18
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:15,869
When a call ends, finish your notes, pick a disposition and complete the activity.

19
00:01:15,869 --> 00:01:19,350
Then check Recent activity before the next offer.

20
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:26,864
Open the soft phone, and choose the Work tab.

21
00:01:26,864 --> 00:01:29,762
You sign in here, not from My workspace.

22
00:01:29,762 --> 00:01:32,220
It reads Signed out until you do.

23
00:01:32,682 --> 00:01:35,924
Under Queues, select the queues you work today.

24
00:01:35,924 --> 00:01:40,512
With agent entitlements, you only see the queues you are entitled to.

25
00:01:40,512 --> 00:01:42,592
Campaigns work the same way.

26
00:01:43,043 --> 00:01:44,251
Click Sign in.

27
00:01:44,251 --> 00:01:47,331
You must pick at least one queue or campaign.

28
00:01:47,331 --> 00:01:51,862
You then become Available, and the Work tab lists each queue with its

29
00:01:51,862 --> 00:01:53,433
own Sign out button.

30
00:01:53,885 --> 00:01:57,701
Sign out leaves one queue and keeps you in the others.

31
00:01:57,701 --> 00:02:01,135
At the end of your shift, click Sign out of all.

32
00:02:05,362 --> 00:02:09,315
Pick your presence from the menu at the top of the soft phone.

33
00:02:09,315 --> 00:02:12,802
My workspace has the same menu in its presence button.

34
00:02:13,270 --> 00:02:15,699
Available means you can receive work.

35
00:02:15,699 --> 00:02:20,160
A reason code, such as Team meeting, makes you not ready and records why.

36
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:23,210
Break reasons are grouped under a Break heading.

37
00:02:23,698 --> 00:02:25,736
Offline stops all work.

38
00:02:25,736 --> 00:02:28,548
It is in the soft phone menu only.

39
00:02:32,727 --> 00:02:35,658
Open Interaction Center, My workspace.

40
00:02:35,658 --> 00:02:40,522
At the top are your name, your presence button, and the connection.

41
00:02:40,522 --> 00:02:43,187
Connected means live updates work.

42
00:02:43,644 --> 00:02:47,144
Signed in to lists the queues you are signed in to, and how

43
00:02:47,144 --> 00:02:51,184
many items are waiting in each, so you can see where the pressure is.

44
00:02:51,637 --> 00:02:55,458
Active interaction shows the call or message you are working.

45
00:02:55,458 --> 00:02:59,677
It says No active interactions right now until you accept something.

46
00:03:00,130 --> 00:03:06,270
Recent activity lists the interactions you finished most recently, with the outcome and the talk time.

47
00:03:10,481 --> 00:03:14,390
While you are signed in, the agent bar sits as a small tab

48
00:03:14,390 --> 00:03:16,833
at the bottom of every admin page.

49
00:03:16,833 --> 00:03:18,604
It shows your presence.

50
00:03:18,604 --> 00:03:20,131
Click it to expand.

51
00:03:20,593 --> 00:03:26,168
It opens by itself when an offer arrives, and when you are connected to a call.

52
00:03:26,168 --> 00:03:28,923
The headset icon opens My workspace.

53
00:03:29,376 --> 00:03:33,337
So you can stay on any page of the CRM, and still answer.

54
00:03:33,337 --> 00:03:38,116
The bar keeps working when the soft phone runs in a window of its own.

55
00:03:42,316 --> 00:03:46,896
An agent who works two queues, and watches both waiting counts.

56
00:03:47,646 --> 00:03:52,566
An agent who works the customer records all day, and answers from the bar.

57
00:03:53,316 --> 00:03:57,578
An agent who steps away for lunch with a reason code, and signs

58
00:03:57,578 --> 00:03:59,246
back in to Available.

59
00:03:59,996 --> 00:04:05,416
A new agent who learns the shift by following the same six steps every day.

60
00:04:07,416 --> 00:04:12,207
Sign in, set your presence, and keep the workspace and the bar in view.

61
00:04:12,207 --> 00:04:15,568
Offers, calls and wrap-up are in the next video.

62
00:04:15,568 --> 00:04:17,186
Thanks for watching.

